    simpa only [pow_two, div_eq_mul_inv] using mul_sound profile2Model aux2Model denominatorProductModel (1691178206719515950584050975 / 182687704666362864775460604089535377456991567872) denominatorProduct_checked hx hy hprofile2 haux2

